; Highlight captures for your grammar. Orlo reads this once language.json has a `tree_sitter`
; block naming it (see README.md). Node names come from your grammar's src/node-types.json;
; the capture names Orlo colours are listed in docs/user-guide/adding-a-language.md.
;
; (comment) @comment
; (string) @string
; (number) @number
; ["if" "else" "while" "return"] @keyword
; (function_definition name: (identifier) @function)
